-- title:
--   Centred Poisson counts are martingales for the natural filtration
-- statement:
--   The running Poisson count on a fixed measurable finite-intensity mark set, centred by its expectation, is an adapted martingale under the σ-algebras generated by earlier time-space observations.
-- source:
